  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "老母ê青春歲月"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b>作者：洪憶心</b><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nGoán老母今年66歲，tùi國校仔畢業13歲就ài開始趁錢，一工八箍ê工錢，沓沓仔加薪到一工13箍、15箍。是按怎beh chiah拚？因為sàn。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nHit-chūn有錢買跤踏車上班算chiâⁿ phāⁿ--ê，tùi大林蒲騎到前鎮加工區ài兩點鐘，來回掛上班lóng總12點鐘，一直做到嫁翁chiah停睏。Goán阿母是前鎮加工區ê第一批女工。若有看公視《奇蹟的女兒》演--ê，成衣加工場內底leh車衫ê情形就thang了解。上下班時間ná一陣騎跤踏車兵團做伙衝--出-來，像狗蟻leh徙siū án-ne chiok恐怖koh刺激。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n1966年前鎮加工區ê設立是政府經濟bái，設立世界第一个加工區出賣勞力替in趁錢。Hit-chūn全世界koh bē少國家來參訪，主要以成衣外銷、皮件加工上濟，1966年goán阿母蹛過香港公司寶利成衣廠、日商三商公司kap開元皮仔加工廠，伊到taⁿ chhng針ê khut-sè koh真好勢，我少年--ê koh輸--伊，莫怪tiāⁿ-tiāⁿ講tùi針黹（chiam-chí）到鋤頭無一項考伊ē倒。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgAwdVxhkEonKJiJz23h4F6BUl5DcNpHUoKsNNaGFg4ZLFHHgvllDA-VjmmwZLgYmicNe0LkuvLmGokv-kMCy85a1rq3l-Uum1WRwt6JMZKc3SyvVlVRcG0yuIRWtnsAPd5HR1JgfRci39/s1600/%25E5%259C%2596+%25E6%25B4%25AA%25E6%2586%25B6%25E5%25BF%2583+%25E8%2580%2581%25E6%25AF%258D%25C3%25AA%25E9%259D%2592%25E6%2598%25A5%25E6%25AD%25B2%25E6%259C%2588.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"947\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"378\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgAwdVxhkEonKJiJz23h4F6BUl5DcNpHUoKsNNaGFg4ZLFHHgvllDA-VjmmwZLgYmicNe0LkuvLmGokv-kMCy85a1rq3l-Uum1WRwt6JMZKc3SyvVlVRcG0yuIRWtnsAPd5HR1JgfRci39/s640/%25E5%259C%2596+%25E6%25B4%25AA%25E6%2586%25B6%25E5%25BF%2583+%25E8%2580%2581%25E6%25AF%258D%25C3%25AA%25E9%259D%2592%25E6%2598%25A5%25E6%25AD%25B2%25E6%259C%2588.png\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nGoán阿母講一領衫ê完成是chiok複雜，逐部位分開做像走khōng-pé-á án-ne，速度kap跤手lóng ài mé-lia̍h，Siat-chuh上歹做。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTuì領下底hit板叫「khi-lí-khai」先車、接肩胛頭鬥手ńg kap腹肚邊、釘鈕仔空、釘鈕仔，最後tńg來kā khi-lí-khai kap鬥領kap--起-來，熨衫到包裝出貨。做一領衫ê循環ài十規个部門，koh因為是手工做--ê，跤手ài khah濟，所以sio爭人beh去上班，「做牛m̄免驚無田thang犁」，真正是hit-chūn上好ê寫照。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n伊ê青春lóng囥tī hia。也莫怪goán細漢tiāⁿ-tiāⁿ lóng有新衫thang穿，我阿母講伊若tī公司做著新ê形體，tńg--來就ē照hit个板--à koh做仝款hō͘ 我kap goán小弟穿，goán細漢就hō͘ 阿母siat-to͘h kah pha-lí-phá-lih，感受阿母ê愛，che lóng是用阿母ê青春換--來--ê。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台灣人寫真專欄，</b></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap白話字。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報302期，2019年5月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n--------------------------------------------<br />\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">有固定的長期捐款， 讓更多的台語文相關計畫可以穩定的推行，感謝逐家。</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
